+// moe_metal.metal - M20: the Qwen3.6-35B-A3B MoE FFN block on Metal, every output BYTE-IDENTICAL to MOE-0's mode-B twin
+// (verified: 72/72 real blocks x 10 stages; reports/llb-mac-m20.md). ENGINE DROP-IN.
+// Source order (the host concatenates; the engine splices the same way after its prelude):
+//   engine prelude (shipped.metal: '#pragma clang fp contract(off)', metal_stdlib, INLINE, u64/u32/u8, WarpArgs, llb_f16)
+//   + M18 kq_metal.metal (KQ<4|9|6> fused K-quant leaves, kq_bfly, kq_span16, kq_pair_tree)
+//   + moe_exact.h (integer soft double: glibc expf, exact fp64 sums, exact float mul/div; Metal FP32 flushes subnormals)
+//   + this file.   Compile with MTLMathModeSafe (the engine's option): no FMA, no reassociation (AIR-checked).
+//
+// ABI / launch table, one MoE layer = 4 dispatches in a SERIAL compute encoder, memoryBarrierWithScope:Buffers between:
+//   1. moe_rdot              grid 65 x 128 thr   buf0 router F32 [256][2048], buf1 shexp gate F32 [2048], buf2 x [2048] (the
+//                                                FFN input = post_attention_norm output), buf3 MoeBuf (device, 2 KB)
+//   2. moe_tail_m0           grid  1 x 288 thr   buf0 MoeBuf                          -> ids[8], wn[8], gs, gr, probs, logits
+//   3. moe_gu_f{4|9}_m0_v0   grid 4608 x 64 thr  buf0/1 expert gate/up base (GGUF Q4_K|Q5_K bytes, 256 experts, stride
+//                                                MoeArgs.eg), buf2/3 shexp gate/up (Q8_0 ROW-SPLIT [2048 int8][64 f16] x 512 rows),
+//                                                buf4 x, buf5 MoeBuf, buf6 act [9][512] (scratch), buf7 MoeArgs (setBytes)
+//   4. moe_dn_f{9|6}_m0_r2   grid 256 x 128 thr  buf0 expert down base (Q5_K|Q6_K, stride MoeArgs.ed), buf1 shexp down (Q8_0 row-split
+//                                                [512 int8][16 f16] x 2048 rows), buf2 act, buf3 MoeBuf, buf4 out: [0,2048) moe_out,
+//                                                [2048,4096) ffn_out = moe_out + shexp * gs (the layer adds the residual), then if
+//                                                MoeArgs.dbg: per-rank down [8][2048] + ungated shexp [2048]; buf5 MoeArgs
